                    user-focused digital experiences that balance
                    functionality, strategy, and strong visual storytelling.
                </p>

                <p>
                    From product interfaces and responsive websites to
                    brand identities and creative campaigns, my approach
                    is rooted in clarity, purposeful design, and attention
                    to detail.
                </p>

                <a href="#expertise" class="pp-inline-link">
